"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 210.415,
"end": 213.494,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3805,
"char_end": 3858,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 213.494,
"end": 217.909,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Once you understand this principle, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3859,
"char_end": 3935,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s04"
},
{
"start": 217.909,
"end": 218.41,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Come back.",
"char_start": 3952,
"char_end": 3962,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 218.41,
"end": 228.098,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within that workflow, the benefits become clear – if you ignore them, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
