"start": 278.618,
"end": 283.287,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the counter-narrative that most listeners are not exposed to?",
"char_start": 5103,
"char_end": 5172,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s02"
},
{
"start": 283.287,
"end": 290.189,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "It boils down to this: a bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 5187,
"char_end": 5303,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s01"
},
{
"start": 290.189,
"end": 294.532,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "The geometry matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 5304,
"char_end": 5377,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s02"
},
{
"start": 294.532,
"end": 296.588,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the typical failure mode?",
"char_start": 5394,
"char_end": 5427,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s01"
},
{
"start": 296.588,
"end": 300.637,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 5428,
"char_end": 5493,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s02"
},
{
"start": 300.637,
"end": 306.511,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Honestly, the wear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 5508,
"char_end": 5612,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 306.511,
"end": 309.504,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 5613,
"char_end": 5666,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 309.504,
"end": 313.401,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5667,
"char_end": 5736,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 313.401,
"end": 315.046,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where does it stop working?",
"char_start": 5753,
"char_end": 5780,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 315.046,
"end": 323.502,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "And when teams adopt Shimano components within that system, the compromise becomes apparent – I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5795,
"char_end": 5951,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 323.502,
"end": 326.486,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always find yourself using?",
"char_start": 5968,
"char_end": 6026,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 326.486,
"end": 330.036,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where do maintenance and the mechanics of the transmission intersect?",
"char_start": 6027,
"char_end": 6096,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 330.036,
"end": 335.733,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Honestly, the maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 6111,
"char_end": 6197,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 335.733,
"end": 340.436,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 6198,
"char_end": 6269,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 340.436,
"end": 345.563,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
"char_start": 6286,
"char_end": 6354,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 345.563,
"end": 349.6,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 6369,
"char_end": 6437,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 349.6,
"end": 351.321,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Everything else is iteration.",
"char_start": 6438,
"char_end": 6467,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 351.321,
"end": 355.189,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Before we close, thank you again to our friends at Linear.",
"char_start": 6484,
"char_end": 6542,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s01"
},
{
"start": 355.189,
"end": 359.991,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Linear is the issue tracker designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 6543,
"char_end": 6615,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s02"
},
{
"start": 359.991,
"end": 362.729,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Luca Moretti, thank you for the conversation.",
"char_start": 6616,
"char_end": 6661,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s03"
},
{
"start": 362.729,
"end": 364.145,
"speaker_label": "Luca Moretti",
"text": "Thank you, Giulia.",
"char_start": 6676,
"char_end": 6694,
"unit_id": "t0041.u01",
"sent_id": "t0041.s01"
},
{
"start": 364.145,
"end": 367.824,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "That's all for today's episode of \"Author's Trails.\"",
"char_start": 6711,
"char_end": 6763,
"unit_id": "t0042.u01",
"sent_id": "t0042.s01"
},
{
"start": 367.824,
"end": 369.098,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "See you next time.",
"char_start": 6764,
"char_end": 6782,
